      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Illaoi and the Vessels she creates spawn Tentacles on nearby impassible terrain. Tentacles swing at spirits, Vessels, and victims of Illaoi's Harsh lesson. Tentacles deal physical damage to enemies hit, and will heal Illaoi if they damage a champion.",
      "summary_zh": "俄洛伊和她创造的躯壳会在附近的不可穿越的地形上生成触手。触手会挥向灵魂，躯壳，以及俄洛伊的【严酷训诫】的受害者们。触手会在命中敌人时造成物理伤害，如果命中目标是英雄还会治疗俄洛伊。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307473:4050910"
      ]
    },
