      "status_terms_zh": [
        "减速"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Illaoi rips the spirit from a foe's body, forcing it to stand before her. Spirits echo a percentage of the damage they take to the original target. If killed, or if the target gets too far from the spirit, the target will become a Vessel and begin spawning Tentacles.",
      "summary_zh": "俄洛伊把灵魂从一名敌人的肉身中扯出，强迫它站在她面前。 灵魂会将其所受的一部分伤害传递到本体上。如果灵魂被击杀，或者本体离灵魂过远，那么本体就会成为一个躯壳并且开始生成触手。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307479:4049942"
      ]
    },
    {
